{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY AND SPECIAL CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE DECEMBER 10, 2019', 'text': 'ROLLINS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.105 PER SHARE AND A SPECIAL YEAR-END DIVIDEND OF $0.05 PER SHARE BOTH PAYABLE DECEMBER 10, 2019 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOVEMBER 11, 2019.'}